## Output Format

- Produce only the final personalized closing message, in natural prose (5–10 sentences).
- Do not describe your reasoning or mention this instruction.
- Do not label sections.
- The result should read as a warm, grounded reflection from a trusted companion who honors the user’s autonomy.
